---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy – Background Changer"
  description="Our privacy policy details how your photos remain 100% on your personal device through browser-side processing."
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 md:py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/40 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-900/60 text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-200">
        <strong class="block mb-1">Local Browser Processing Notice:</strong>
        Images are processed locally in your browser memory. Your photographs, portraits, and personal documents never leave your device and are not uploaded to or stored on any external servers.
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">
        1. Image Data Handling
      </h2>
      <p>
        When you upload an image to Background Changer (onlinebackgroundchange.com), the entire segmentation, mask generation, cropping, color replacement, and export workflow executes locally using your device's web browser APIs (HTML5 Canvas, WebAssembly, and client-side neural execution). We do not transmit your photos to any remote server or third-party database.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">
        2. No Accounts or Registrations
      </h2>
      <p>
        Background Changer requires no account creation, email sign-up, passwords, or personal credentials. You can access and utilize all tools instantly and anonymously.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">
        3. Local Storage Preferences
      </h2>
      <p>
        We store only your theme preference (Light, Dark, or System mode) within your browser's local storage (`localStorage`). No tracking pixels, third-party behavioral cookies, or invasive analytics are embedded.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">
        4. Contact Us
      </h2>
      <p>
        For security questions or privacy inquiries regarding our utility, reach out to <a href="mailto:suryaprasadrout1261@gmail.com" class="text-blue-600 underline">suryaprasadrout1261@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
